  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe guide now has eight sections in job order.\nThe sidebar reads the sections and pages from Zola.\nIt opens the current section and marks the current page.\nThe guide index gives a linked Start here path.\n\nTwenty-four moved pages retain their old URLs through aliases.\nThe operations overview keeps its URL and heading anchors.\nInternal links and operation picture paths follow the new locations.\nThe section introductions link to existing topic guidance.\n\nThe branch starts from upstream/main at 8719d8b7a.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe guide listed its pages in one flat sequence.\nThe section template did not list child sections.\nReaders could not use the guide navigation to follow the stages of a job.\n\n## Tests\n\nThese regression pins failed on unchanged upstream and pass with the fix:\n\n- `test_sidebar_groups_follow_a_job_on_every_guide_page`\n- `test_section_indexes_and_sidebar_reach_every_moved_page`\n- `test_old_urls_redirect_to_the_relocated_pages`\n- `test_guide_index_has_a_start_here_path`\n\n`test_built_internal_links_and_anchors_resolve` passes before and after the change.\nThe three existing operation picture tests also pass.\n\nRestoring upstream `page.html` made the sidebar pin fail.\nRestoring upstream `section.html` made the sidebar pin fail.\nRestoring the upstream content tree made the guide regression pins fail.\nEach restoration of the fix made the affected tests pass again.\n\n`python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests -v` passes all eight tests.\nThe tests build under a deployment URL prefix and check all 24 aliases.\nZola's generated alias redirects preserve URL fragments.\n`zola build` passes with Zola 0.23.6: 42 pages and 10 sections.\n\n`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passes.\nIt selects no Rust tests because no crates changed.\nClippy does not apply because no Rust crates changed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nBrowser rendering and interactive behavior were not exercised.\nThe link checks cover local pages and anchors, not external websites.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone.\nThe file overlap checks found no open PR that changes these files.\n\nEffort: medium. No escalation.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nFixes #1903\n",
